<.section_heading>
  {dgettext("landing", "Private sessions connect directly via WebRTC.")}
</.section_heading>
<.inset
  class="p-3 mb-2"
  aria-label={dgettext("landing", "WebRTC signaling and data flow diagram")}
>
  <.diagram_p2p_flow class="w-full max-w-lg mx-auto" />
</.inset>
<p class="text-sm mb-1">
  {dgettext(
    "landing",
    "For private calls, file transfer, and multiplayer games, the server only handles"
  )}
  <strong>signaling</strong> {dgettext(
    "landing",
    "— helping users find each other. Once connected, all data flows directly between browsers via WebRTC."
  )}
</p>
<p class="text-sm">
  {dgettext(
    "landing",
    "If a direct connection isn’t possible (strict firewalls), a"
  )}
  <strong>{dgettext("landing", "TURN relay")}</strong> {dgettext(
    "landing",
    "is used as fallback while WebRTC transport encryption remains in place."
  )}
</p>
